### List jobs — first page (default)
GET {{base_url}}/jobs

###

### List jobs — page 2, 20 per page
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?page=2&limit=20

###

### List jobs — filter by status: pending
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?status=pending

###

### List jobs — filter by status: running
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?status=running

###

### List jobs — filter by status: awaiting_approval
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?status=awaiting_approval

###

### List jobs — filter by status: done
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?status=done

###

### List jobs — filter by status: failed
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?status=failed

###

### List jobs — search by trace_id
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?trace_id={{trace_id}}

###

### List jobs — combined filters
GET {{base_url}}/jobs?status=done&page=1&limit=5
